stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disabled
    Disabled --> Enabled: plugins enable
    Enabled --> ColdLoad: service start
    ColdLoad --> ReadyStale: load pluginDataDir snapshot
    ColdLoad --> Loading: no snapshot
    ReadyStale --> Loading: timer / IPC refresh
    Loading --> PartialReady: some providers ready
    Loading --> Ready: all enabled providers ready
    Loading --> AuthRequired: provider auth_required
    Loading --> RateLimited: provider rate_limited
    Loading --> NetworkError: provider network_error
    Loading --> Error: provider api_error / bad_response
    PartialReady --> Loading: timer
    Ready --> Loading: timer
    RateLimited --> Loading: timer
    NetworkError --> Loading: timer / manual
    Error --> Loading: timer / manual refresh
    AuthRequired --> Loading: after CLI auth + refresh
    Enabled --> Disabled: plugins disable

    note right of PartialReady
      Error isolation:
      one provider down
      does not blank dashboard
    end note
